    <h2>5. Momentum Dynamics & Liquidity Behavior</h2>
    <p>Moving-average crossovers (50/200-day) capture medium-term trend shifts. Golden crosses have historically preceded multi-year rallies; death crosses have coincided with corrections or extended bear phases.</p>
    <img class="chart" src="data:image/png;base64,{data['img6']}" alt="Price with MA crossovers and volume">
