      <li><strong>Volatility regimes are sticky.</strong> Crisis states do not resolve overnight; risk models should use regime-switching rather than single-state volatility assumptions.</li>
      <li><strong>Seasonal edges are statistically weak.</strong> Do not overweight calendar-based tactical trades without additional confirming signals.</li>
